  "solution": "Here, we will go by the options and used BODMAS\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/59d2980c5109c87f68ca073b3b699626189e1c9d83fa01b7b559eec34a6ca320.png] \n\n**Given Equation :- 52 ÷ 13 +6 − 25 × 2 = 17**\n\nInterchanging the numbers as per the options\n\nOption (1) 6 and 25\n\n⇒**__52 ÷ 13__ **+ 25 − 6 × 2 = 17\n\n⇒ 4 + 25 - **__6 × 2__ **= 17 \n\n⇒__ **4 + 25**__** **- 12 = 17\n\n⇒__ **29 - 12**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 17 = 17\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS **\n\nOption(2) 13 and 2\n\n⇒**__52 ÷ 2__ **+ 6 − 25 ×13 = 17\n\n⇒ 26 + 6 -__ **25 × 13**__** **= 17\n\n⇒ **__26 + 6__ **- 325 = 17\n\n⇒ 32 - 325 = 17\n\n⇒ - 293 = 17 (which is not possible)\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\nOption(3) 13 and 25\n\n⇒ **__52 ÷ 25 __**+ 6 −13 × 2 = 17\n\n⇒ 2.08 + 6 - **__13 × 2 __**= 17\n\n⇒ **__2.08 + 6__** - 26 = 17\n\n⇒__ 8.08 - 26__ = 17\n\n⇒ - 17.92 = 17(which is not possible)\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption(4) 6 and 2\n\n⇒__ **52 ÷ 13**__** **+** **2** **− 25 × 6 = 17\n\n⇒ 4 + 2 -__ **25 × 6**__ = 17\n\n⇒**__ 4 + 2 __**- 150 = 17\n\n⇒ 8 - 150 = 17\n\n⇒ -142 = 17(which is not possible)\n\n**⇒** LHS ≠ RHS\n\n Therefore, only option(1) satisfies the above equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **option(1).**",
